000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RATPET01.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE UNDERWRITING SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* RATPET01  PET RATING
000600* CALLED BY PRMCALC (BATCH) AND PRMCALC0 (CICS) AS 'RATPET01'.
000700* SETS RATE-BASE-PREMIUM FROM THE SUM-INSURED BAND, THEN ADDS
000800* LINE LOADINGS AND DISCOUNTS FROM THE 60-BYTE RISK DETAIL.
000900* BANDS AND RATES ARE THE SAME AS dw.ref_rate_band IN claimsdb.
001000*================================================================
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001300     COPY RDPET.
001400 01  WS-BAND                     PIC X(02).
001500 01  WS-PCT                      PIC 9V9999.
001600 LINKAGE SECTION.
001700     COPY POLREC.
001800     COPY RATEREC.
001900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD.
002000 0000-MAIN.
002100     MOVE POL-RISK-DETAIL TO WS-PET-DETAIL
002200     PERFORM 1000-BASE-RATE
002300     PERFORM 2000-LOADINGS
002400     MOVE ZERO TO RATE-RETURN-CODE
002500     GOBACK.
002600 1000-BASE-RATE.
002700     EVALUATE TRUE
002800         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 2000
002900             MOVE 'B1' TO WS-BAND
003000             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003100                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.07599
003200         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 4000
003300             MOVE 'B2' TO WS-BAND
003400             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003500                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.07182
003600         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 7000
003700             MOVE 'B3' TO WS-BAND
003800             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003900                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.05553
004000         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 12000
004100             MOVE 'B4' TO WS-BAND
004200             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004300                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.05141
004400         WHEN OTHER
004500*            ABOVE THE TOP BAND: RATE AT THE TOP BAND, REFER
004600             MOVE 'XX' TO WS-BAND
004700             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004800                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.05141
004900             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
005000     END-EVALUATE
005100     IF RATE-BASE-PREMIUM < 60.00
005200         MOVE 60.00 TO RATE-BASE-PREMIUM
005300     END-IF.
005400 2000-LOADINGS.
005500     EVALUATE WS-SPECIES
005600         WHEN 'D'
005700             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
005800                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
005900         WHEN 'C'
006000             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
006100                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.075
006200         WHEN 'R'
006300             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
006400                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.125
006500         WHEN OTHER
006600             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
006700     END-EVALUATE
006800     IF WS-BREED-BAND > 3
006900         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007000             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.250
007100     END-IF
007200     IF WS-BREED-BAND > 9
007300         SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
007400     END-IF
007500     IF WS-PET-AGE > 8
007600         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007700             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.075
007800     END-IF
007900     IF WS-PRE-EXISTING = 'Y'
008000         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
008100             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
008200     END-IF
008300     IF WS-NEUTERED = 'Y'
008400         COMPUTE RATE-DISCOUNTS ROUNDED = RATE-DISCOUNTS
008500             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
008600     END-IF.
